<section class="section-container not-prose" id="fees">
  <div class="mb-8 md:mx-auto md:mb-12 text-center max-w-3xl">
    <h2 class="font-heading mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-white">
      Know what you're paying for.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xl text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
      We clearly distinguish our service fees from government and third-party charges.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-none md:p-8 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Our service fee</h3>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        The amount charged by SK Immigration for the agreed service. You'll receive a written scope before payment.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-none md:p-8 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Government / third-party fees</h3>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        Separate fees charged by governments, embassies, universities, visa application centres, medical providers,
        couriers, registration authorities and other third parties.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        Those charges are not SK Immigration's service fee, and they are paid to the relevant provider.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
